---
// 篇3 图1：allocate_slots 的五段布局
// | comp | new_comp | ext_comp | new | lookahead |
// 前缀缓存命中（本地+外部）、待计算、投机预占
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 272" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="24" font-size="13.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">一个请求这一步的 token，分五段记账</text>

      {/* 五段条 */}
      <rect x="40" y="60" width="120" height="56" rx="6" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="100" y="84" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">comp</text>
      <text x="100" y="102" font-size="8.5" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">之前已算</text>

      <rect x="160" y="60" width="100" height="56" rx="6" fill="#cfe6ef" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="210" y="84" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">new_comp</text>
      <text x="210" y="102" font-size="8.5" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">本地前缀刚命中</text>

      <rect x="260" y="60" width="100" height="56" rx="6" fill="#b9d8e8" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="310" y="84" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">ext_comp</text>
      <text x="310" y="102" font-size="8.5" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">连接器外部命中</text>

      <rect x="360" y="60" width="150" height="56" rx="6" fill="#fdf0e0" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <text x="435" y="84" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">new</text>
      <text x="435" y="102" font-size="8.5" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">这一步要算（含未验证草稿）</text>

      <rect x="510" y="60" width="90" height="56" rx="6" fill="#f3e8fb" stroke="#7c5fa8"/>
      <text x="555" y="84" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b4f8f" text-anchor="middle">lookahead</text>
      <text x="555" y="102" font-size="8.5" fill="#6b4f8f" text-anchor="middle">投机预占</text>

      {/* 标注大括号 */}
      <line x1="360" y1="132" x2="555" y2="132" stroke="#94a3b8"/>
      <text x="457" y="148" font-size="9.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">要新分配物理块的范围</text>

      <line x1="40" y1="170" x2="360" y2="170" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="200" y="186" font-size="9.5" fill="#006377" text-anchor="middle">已有/命中的 KV：引用已有块，命中即 touch</text>

      {/* 三道关卡 */}
      <rect x="40" y="206" width="560" height="48" rx="8" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#cbd5e1"/>
      <text x="56" y="226" font-size="9.5" fill="#334155">分配三阶段：① 释放窗口外旧块、估算所需块数（不够→返回 None，篇4 抢占）</text>
      <text x="56" y="244" font-size="9.5" fill="#334155">② 挂上命中块（本地 + 连接器）　③ 为 new + lookahead 分配新块，并把已确认 token 缓存</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
